        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1a) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1b) The deputy chief executive officers of the Inland Revenue Board of Malaysia appointed under subsection 6a(2) of the Inland Revenue Board of Malaysia Act 1995 shall be the Deputy Directors General of Inland Revenue.”; dan"
