      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Bahagian XIV Bahagian yang berikut: “Part XV 1. Notwithstanding Part I, income tax shall be charged for a specified year of assessment on the chargeable income of an approved individual under the Returning Expert Programme in respect of having or exercising employment with a person in Malaysia at the rate of 15 per cent on every ringgit of that chargeable income. 2. In this Part— (a) an approved individual and the specified year of assessment referred to in paragraph 1; and (b) where the individual has income from a source other than the employment referred to in paragraph 1 or where subsection 45(2) applies, the chargeable income of the individual referred to in that paragraph, shall be as determined by the Minister by rules made under this Act.”. Pindaan Jadual 4b"
